<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Bank Melbourne cuts mortgage rate.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Bank Melbourne cuts mortgage rate.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Melbourne Ltd said on Tuesday that it would lower its standard variable mortgage rate by 70 basis points to 7.55 percent, matching the key housing rate of other large banks.</p>
<p>The bank said the new rate would take effect immediately for new customers and at the end of April for existing borrowers.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
